   b) Distribute a changed version of the Author's Work, under this name or
      any other. The permission in 2 (c) covers your own installation only.

   c) Charge for the Addon, place it behind a paywall, require a payment,
      subscription or donation for access to it, or use it to carry
      advertising.

   d) Copy any part of the Author's Work into another addon or into any other
      work, with or without attribution.

   The Addon is distributed only through the channels named by the author. At
